WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.605 --> 00:00:10.506
The yellow box reports the status of
the current position: no clashes.

2
00:00:10.606 --> 00:00:18.435
While dragging, the pills show
what each spot would cost.

3
00:00:18.535 --> 00:00:24.436
Here: 15 students clash (red)
and a teacher clash (purple).

4
00:00:24.536 --> 00:00:30.438
“Áhrif breytingar” (effect of the
change): before → after.

5
00:00:30.538 --> 00:00:35.439
PRÓ124F shares 15 students,
and prufa1 teaches it then.

6
00:00:35.539 --> 00:00:41.441
Room HT-104: ⛔ – it is booked in
TermTime. A booking would fail.

7
00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:45.442
Bóka (book) is blocked
while a ⛔ stands.

8
00:00:45.542 --> 00:00:55.539
Thursday in V02-152: ⚠ – PRÓ124F's
lab has it in Núverandi lausn.

9
00:00:55.639 --> 00:01:04.423
Friday 10:00 is free:
no pills, no clashes.

10
00:01:04.523 --> 00:01:10.424
Tímafjöldi: number of 50-minute
slots. 3 makes it longer.

11
00:01:10.524 --> 00:01:15.425
Tegund (type): what kind of
session, as in TermTime.

12
00:01:15.525 --> 00:01:20.427
Athugasemd (note) goes to the
room administrators.

13
00:01:20.527 --> 00:01:25.429
Weeks: click on and off –
here week 9 is left out.

14
00:01:25.529 --> 00:01:30.600
One save for all of it:
Staðfesta og vista.

15
00:01:34.703 --> 00:01:44.371
Bóka: books exactly what the card shows.
Unsaved changes are saved first.

16
00:01:44.471 --> 00:01:51.372
Booked: the box turns green, and the
course is read back from TermTime.

17
00:01:51.472 --> 00:02:00.954
A booked session moved and saved: purple –
TermTime still has the old time.

18
00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:14.336
“Uppfæra bókun” (update booking)
moves the booking too.

19
00:02:14.436 --> 00:02:20.338
“Fjarlægja bókun” deletes it in TermTime;
the session stays, blue.

20
00:02:30.444 --> 00:02:44.673
Try freely, then Núllstilla:
nothing is saved or booked.
